= Research Group

<p><img src="assets/img/hanyang-erica-campus.png" alt="Hanyang University ERICA campus" style="width: 50%; height: auto;" /></p>

~~~
*Students interested in these research directions can find more information on the [/join.html Join the Group] page.*
